        <Param val="WELCOME&amp;#10;In this experiment, you will complete a series of&amp;#10;tasks involving five-letter words and letter combinations.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You will complete two types of tasks. In some trials,&amp;#10;you will focus on the middle letter of the stimulus,&amp;#10;while in other trials, you will focus on the entire word.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You will respond using the keyboard according to the&amp;#10;instructions for each task.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;On some trials, the number 7 will appear in one of&amp;#10;the five positions. Whenever you see the number 7,&amp;#10;press SPACE as quickly and accurately as possible.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please keep your eyes on the screen and respond as&amp;#10;quickly and accurately as you can while avoiding mistakes.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Before the actual experiment begins, you will complete&amp;#10;a short practice session to become familiar with both tasks.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press SPACE to begin the practice." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
